  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the implementation of the Local Public Administration Reform in Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Republic of Moldova was granted candidate status for the European Union (EU) in June 2022 and started accession negotiations in June 2024. The Public Administration Reform Strategy (PARS), approved in 2023, outlines a clear path to advance the objectives related to EU integration- effective governance through capable central and local authorities, professional civil servants, transparent and modern processes - with a significant emphasis on local governance, dedicating an entire chapter to t</narrative>
  </description>
